@startuml
title C4 Level 1 - StockApp CURRENT y TARGET (sin deployment cloud)
actor "Propietario" as user
rectangle "StockApp Mobile\nCURRENT local / TARGET sync" as mobile <<SoftwareSystem>>
rectangle "StockApp Web App\nTARGET autenticada" as web <<SoftwareSystem>>
rectangle "StockApp Backend/API\nTARGET comandos y sync" as api <<SoftwareSystem>>
database "Cloud Database\nTARGET dataset aceptado" as db <<SoftwareSystem>>
rectangle "ian-k.dev Public Website\nCURRENT marketing/legales" as public <<SoftwareSystem>>
cloud "Railway\nSupporting hosting" as railway <<External>>
cloud "Cloudflare Pages / DNS / TLS\nSupporting infrastructure" as cf <<External>>
rectangle "SMTP provider\nTARGET email de identidad" as mail <<External>>
user --> mobile : Opera offline
user --> web : Opera online
user --> public : Lee informacion publica
mobile --> api : TARGET sync HTTPS
web --> api : TARGET API HTTPS
api --> db : Transacciones
api --> mail : Verificar/reset email
railway ..> api : Aloja
railway ..> db : Aloja
cf ..> web : Entrega SPA
cf ..> public : Hosting separado
@enduml
